    <title>EP 06 - 时空中的绘旅人｜螺提种种，要何去何从呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ad0fec7349f7a557622146</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ad0fec7349f7a557622146</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Aug 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！第六期聊到『时空中的绘旅人』。作为四大国乙之一的它似乎是相对低调的，于是我们还是想从它的世界观与背景、系统、人物聊起，向大家安利它好的地方，同时也分析到一些这么几年玩下来的、也许能让它不再那么“低调”的点。来听肝肝和象象分析吧！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【本期小画家旅程】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 好多个世界啊——当时很新的背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> 来看看男主们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 傲娇小王子艾因🎹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 温柔天文学长路辰✨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 甜美幽默总裁罗夏🦁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 正义刀王司岚(光辉灿烂——⚖️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a> 神秘美丽“养父”叶瑄🖌️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 这些卡面和细节真的很戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 文案节奏、恋爱感与小游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 来听听海螺肉很有宿命感的主题曲吧</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【来找我们玩】有喜欢乙游(或者各类女性向游戏)的朋友们，可以添加小助手加入听友群快乐讨论纸片人哦～二维码在这💝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSa1QtDQvK4ePrzD8M42pdw0H5a.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【制作】主播/剪辑：肝肝&amp;象象​</span></p>]]></description>
