    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个月不见！第五期聊我们同样在1.18火速出圈的『世界之外』。虽说最初是靠营销出圈的，但它却真有了点“红极一时”的意味在。于是我们决定深挖一下它的魅力所在。那么目前它的世界观与背景、系统、人物、优缺点是如何的呢？且听肝肝和象象分析！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【本期大强议程】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> (前面的一堆废话)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> “无限流”&amp;“言情”：不完成任务就会人死灯灭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a> 朴素的玩法、交互和卡牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">3:56</a> 登上四大洲顶峰，宿命感爱情来去匆匆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">6:05</a> 委屈卑微霸总顾时夜🥺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">8:22</a> 温柔腹黑大侄子易遇😈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 仙气残暴鳏夫夏萧因😡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 忠诚小狗狗骑士柏源☺️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 系统哥到底是不是前夫哥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 到底哪里大强？朴素(土)而上头的文案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 叙事一反，悬念一来，欲罢不能，却要离开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 戏里戏外都拿着手机，代入感plus</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 男主攻略我，好感度是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 大吐槽特吐槽：AI图到底是什么意思？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 这个UI到底是什么意思？叠卡又是什么意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 继续激情辱骂AI图(？)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 为什么我们会觉得世外“不够媚女”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 我俩感人肺腑的总结(鼓掌)和乙游相关闲聊(笑死)</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【来找我们玩】有喜欢乙游(或者各类女性向游戏)的朋友们，可以添加小助手加入听友群快乐讨论纸片人哦～二维码在这💝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSa1QtDQvK4ePrzD8M42pdw0H5a.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【制作】主播/剪辑：肝肝&amp;象象</span></p>]]></description>
